; ==============================================================================
; NIGHTWARE LABZ: Demoscene Holographic Cyberpunk IR Engine
; Pure Krell surface syntax. Zero external dependencies.
; Runs continuously until interrupted (Ctrl+C).
; Features:
;   - Fullscreen auto-adapting resolution via kc_winsize / ioctl
;   - Double-buffered zero-flicker 24-bit truecolor ANSI output
;   - 3D Volumetric Undulating Typography ("NIGHTWARE LABZ") with dynamic wave ripples
;   - Dynamic multi-layer 3D extrusion (specular front face, bevel, deep shadow)
;   - Real-time laser chrome sweep with white-hot specular highlights
;   - Retro-futuristic synthwave perspective ground grid with high-speed travel
;   - Cosmic multi-harmonic plasma nebula and twinkling starfield
;   - Dual 3D intersecting quantum gyroscope rings with depth testing
;   - Real-time 32-band procedural synthesizer audio spectrum visualizer
;   - Cyberpunk demoscene telemetry HUD and frame counter
; ==============================================================================

